<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5855] SQL: BigInteger support broken in SQL queries.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5855</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Looks like BigInteger support in SQL was broken.&lt;br/&gt;
It works fine on ignite-1.9&lt;br/&gt;
PFA reproducer.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
